<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title><%= yield_content "title" %></title>
  <meta name="description" content="Kurt is an MVC web framework for iyi. Every file has one place, AGENTS.md writes the rules down, and kurt build ships the application as one native binary.">
  <link rel="preload" as="font" type="font/woff2" href="/assets/fonts/chakra-petch-700-latin.woff2" crossorigin>
  <link rel="preload" as="font" type="font/woff2" href="/assets/fonts/ubuntu-400-latin.woff2" crossorigin>
  <link rel="icon" href="/icon.svg?v=3" type="image/svg+xml">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#313338">
  <script>
    try {
      if (localStorage.getItem("kurt-theme") === "light") document.documentElement.dataset.theme = "light";
    } catch (e) {}
  </script>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/site.css?v=21">
</head>
<body>
  <a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
  <header class="masthead">
    <div class="masthead-inner">
      <a class="wordmark" href="/" aria-label="Kurt, home">
        <img src="/brand/kurt-mark.svg?v=3" alt="" width="30" height="30">
        <span>Kurt</span>
      </a>
      <nav id="site-nav" aria-label="Sections">
        <ul>
          <% nav_items.each do |item| %>
          <li><a href="<%= item[0] %>"<%= raw(current_attr(item[0])) %>><%= item[1] %></a></li>
          <% end %>
          <li><a href="https://iyi.dev/">iyi</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://github.com/iyikurt/kurt">GitHub</a></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>
      <div class="masthead-controls">
        <button type="button" class="icon-button scheme-toggle" data-paper="#ffffff" data-paper-dark="#313338">
          <svg class="to-dark" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M14 8.53A6 6 0 1 1 7.47 2a4.67 4.67 0 0 0 6.53 6.53z"></path></svg>
          <svg class="to-light" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="3"></circle><path d="M8 1.1V3.4M8 12.6V14.9M1.1 8H3.4M12.6 8H14.9M3.12 3.12l1.63 1.63M11.25 11.25l1.63 1.63M3.12 12.88l1.63-1.63M11.25 4.75l1.63-1.63"></path></svg>
          <span class="visually-hidden">Switch the colour scheme</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="icon-button menu-toggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="site-nav" aria-label="Menu">
          <span class="bars" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>
  <main id="main">
    <%= content %>
  </main>
  <footer class="colophon">
    <div class="colophon-inner">
      <div class="colophon-top">
        <div class="colophon-brand">
          <a class="wordmark" href="/">
            <img src="/brand/kurt-mark.svg?v=3" alt="" width="36" height="36">
            <span>Kurt</span>
          </a>
          <p><strong>Kurt is Turkish for wolf.</strong> It is an MVC web framework for iyi: models read their columns from the database, views are compiled with the app, and <code>kurt build</code> ships everything as one file.</p>
          <div><a class="button" href="/docs">Read the docs</a></div>
        </div>
        <nav class="colophon-links" aria-label="Footer">
          <ul>
            <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
            <% nav_items.each do |item| %>
            <li><a href="<%= item[0] %>"><%= item[1] %></a></li>
            <% end %>
          </ul>
          <ul>
            <li><a href="https://github.com/iyikurt/kurt">Source on GitHub</a></li>
            <li><a href="https://iyi.dev/">iyi</a></li>
            <li><a href="https://github.com/sdogruyol/iyi-web">iyi-web</a></li>
            <li><a href="https://github.com/iyilang/db">db</a></li>
            <li><a href="https://forum.iyi.dev/">Forum</a></li>
          </ul>
        </nav>
      </div>
      <p class="colophon-bottom">
        <span>Kurt 0.1.0 · needs iyi <a href="https://iyi.dev/install/">0.21.0</a> or later</span>
        <span>This site is a Kurt application: <a href="https://github.com/iyikurt/website">its source</a>.</span>
      </p>
    </div>
  </footer>
  <p id="copy-status" class="visually-hidden" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
  <script src="/assets/site.js?v=21" defer></script>
  <%= raw(live_reload_tag) %>
</body>
</html>
